# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# COPYRIGHTED MATERIAL -- never commit, never push.
#
# Roland's firmware, wave ROMs and manuals belong to Roland. This repository only says
# WHERE a user must put their own dumps (roms/README.md); it never carries them.
#
# If you really need to add a binary that matches one of these patterns and is NOT
# copyrighted (a test fixture you generated yourself), use `git add -f` and say why in
# the commit message.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Program and wave ROMs, in every naming scheme seen so far
#   Nuked-SC55: sc55_rom1.bin, sc55_waverom1.bin, rom1.bin, rom_sm.bin
#   MAME:       roland_r15199778_6435328a97f.ic30 and the like
*.bin
*.BIN
*.rom
*.ROM
*.ic[0-9]*
*.IC[0-9]*
*.eprom
*.hex

# MAME ROM sets and archives of dumps
*.zip
*.7z
*.chd

# The roms/ folder holds only its README
roms/*
!roms/README.md

# Recordings and renders of the factory sounds (derived from the ROMs)
*.wav
*.WAV
*.flac
*.aif
*.aiff
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.raw

# SysEx dumps and MIDI files of other people's songs
*.syx
*.SYX
*.mid
*.MID

# Roland manuals, service notes and datasheets
reference/*.pdf

# Photos of real hardware (copyright of whoever took them)
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.JPG

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build products and tools
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/
.claude.json

# The Windows installer (installer/build.sh)
installer/*.exe
